    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T18:34:49Z",
    "body": "The post is ready on the contributor branch at `5081fd8f6`. It builds on the machine definition in #3204. The comparison starts at the revised machine commit so it shows only the post changes. [Review the post changes](https://github.com/qsmits/Camcraft/compare/e6e04f5d05e4d324ec8d758f6a5ef54a8181a06d...5081fd8f62523f26a3fdba262ef6f41f110ee56e)\n\nThe quick gate passed all 385 steps and recorded 3,009 test passes. The heavy gate passed all 199 steps. Strict Clippy passed for all targets in the app and post crates. The app and CLI tests cover refusal before an existing file changes.\n\nThe final CLI reproduced both programs from the iTNC 530 station tests byte for byte. On station software `606425 004 SP20`, the single-tool program reached 3 of 3 programmed stops and the two-tool program reached 5 of 5. Both reached program end. The physical checks on the Picomax with `340490-03` remain open.\n\nI will open the second upstream PR when #3204 reaches main, so its diff contains only the post changes.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
